{
 "header": [
  "The shaders of the page's prebuilt list, recorded by N64Recomp-browser's tools/record_shaders.mjs",
  "(tools/record_shaders.sh), a page load a section. Every load: the launcher, Load ROM on a new profile, Start Game,",
  "then Start (Enter) through the splashes and the title to the main menu, all of it section 0, built before the",
  "game starts. Then each of Season's twenty tracks is reached by A (Space) through Season's menus to rider select,",
  "with the race it starts put on the track (tools/shader_survey.js's setTrack(), as Season's round); each special",
  "track through the main menu's Special Tracks, its item opened and chosen (special()); and the tutorial as the",
  "rounds menu's last item (menu()). A section presses A into its race, past the track's intro to the countdown,",
  "holds the throttle for 40 s of it and opens the pause menu and closes it; Original Excitebike's starts its game",
  "and rides it for 30 s. The user track (the editor's) is left out: it is built from the outdoor tracks' pieces."
 ],
